      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得到",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x>2,\\\\↵x<4\\end{array}\\right.$ 或 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x<2,\\\\x>4.\\end{array}\\right.$",
        "前一个不等式组的解集合是数区间 $]2,4[$. 后一个不等",
        "式组的解集合是空集. 原不等式的解集合是：",
        "$]2,4[\\cup\\varnothing=]2,4[$.",
        "答：$]2,4[$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2 解不等式 $\\frac{2x-3}{5-4x}<0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分式的值为负，当且仅当分子和分母的值有不同的符号.",
        "这就是说，原不等式是真不等式，必须并且只须变量 $x$ 所取的",
        "值满足下列不等式组之一：",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}2x-3>0,\\\\↵5-4x<0\\end{array}\\right.$ 或 $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}2x-3<0,\\\\5-4x>0.\\end{array}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解其中的每个不等式组，求得前一个不等式组的解集合",
        "是数区间 $]1.5,+\\infty[$，后一个不等式组的解集合是数区间",
        "$]-\\infty,1.25[$. 原不等式的解集合是",
        "$]-\\infty,1.25[\\cup]1.5,+\\infty[$.",
        "答：$]-\\infty,1.25[\\cup]1.5,+\\infty[$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3 解不等式 $\\frac{3x-2}{x-2}>3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个不等式容易换成它的同解不等式，并使同解不等式",
        "的左边是含有变量的分式，而右边是零. 为此，我们把 $3$ 带上",
        "相反的符号移到原不等式的左边，并把所得到的差变形成分",
        "式："
      ]
    },
